<title>USA: SouthFirst declares quarterly div $0.125.</title>
<headline>SouthFirst declares quarterly div $0.125.</headline>
<dateline>SYLACAUGA, Ala. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount	  $0.125		    $0.125</p>
<p> Pay	     May 15</p>
<p> Record	  May 1</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is SouthFirst Bancshares Inc.</p>
<p>The company said its recently announced mergers will be immediately accretive to earnigns per share.</p>
<p>These mergers are with Pension Benefit &amp; Financial Services Inc and with First Federal Savings and Loan Association.</p>
